                "TEXTINFO": "<div class='well_white'>\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-10 col-md-6 text-center\">\r\n<h3> Choose simple or decorative decreases</h3>\r\n <div class=\"videopopup\" data-videotitle=\"decrease_choices\" data-vimeoid=\"1037523987\">\r\n<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" width=\"400\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1959526498-e0dd522dce77a98a85af3a6ca2544d9b0df05e31572711e3b77d5096f40df83b-d_1280x720?r=pad\">\r\n\r\n\t\t<div class=\"imagecenter text-center\"><button class=\"btn btn-sm\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x learn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>\t\t\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>"
