    {
      "title": "Finishing",
      "slug": "finishing",
      "displayOrder": 7,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 861,
        "lessonOrder": 7
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3>The Magic of Finishing</h3>\r\nDon't rush these last steps! Taking your time with blocking and seaming makes all the difference. These finishing touches are what turn your knitting into pieces that look polished and professional - items you'll be proud to wear, gift or sell.<br><b>Finishing Instructions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Block with <a data-GlossaryId=\"300\" class=\"glossaryhelp\">Blocking Wires <i class=\"fa fa-question-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\r\n<li>Using the extra seaming stitches you added,<span data-GlossaryId=\"314\" class=\"glossaryhelp underlineit\"> Mattress Stitch</span> the wedges and hat seam</li>\r\n<li>To close the center top, run a tail of yarn through the last few stitches at the top of the cap</li>\r\n<li>Seam the ribbing so the seam is hidden when the brim is folded up </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9970,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "imageGallery",
              "slides": [
                {
                  "src": "/v2/129/finishing41.jpg",
                  "caption": "Reverse the right and wrong side of the ribbing seam so when the ribbing is folded up the seam does not show."
                },
                {
                  "src": "/v2/129/finishing2.jpg",
                  "caption": "Neatly mattress stitch the side seam - aligning the markers at the beginning of the shaping."
                },
                {
                  "src": "/v2/129/finishing31.jpg",
                  "caption": "By working the decrease AT LEAST 1 stitch from the edge, the edge stitch can be used for neat seaming"
                },
                {
                  "src": "/v2/129/finishing.jpg",
                  "caption": "Use that extra stitch for a neat seam"
                }
              ],
              "legacy": {
                "enableAudio": "0",
                "playAudio": "1"
              },
              "legacyComponentId": 9971,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
          "title": "The Final Touch",
          "slug": "the-final-touch",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6427,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
